flowchart TB
    IDM["IdM / FreeIPA<br/>provides identity, host, access, and marker truth"] --> EIGEN["eigenstate.ipa<br/>reads IdM state into inventory"]
    EIGEN --> AAP["AAP preflight<br/>selects suitable targets before launch"]
    AAP --> SSH["SSH to managed host"]
    SSH --> PAM["SSSD + pam_selinux<br/>apply mapped login label"]
    PAM --> BW["Confined automation session<br/>runs under host SELinux policy"]
    BW --> LOCAL["Local root work<br/>inside SELinux boundary"]
    BW --> BLOCK["Exploit surfaces denied<br/>by versioned policy"]
